<title>USA: Southern Pacific buys Hallmark.</title>
<headline>Southern Pacific buys Hallmark.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE OSWEGO, Ore 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Pacific Funding Corp said it acquired 90 percent of the equity of Hallmark Government Mortgage Inc for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Hallmark Government Mortgage Inc will operate as a subsidiary of Southern Pacific Funding Corp under the name Hallmark America, Inc (&quot;Hallmark America&quot;).  The remaining 10 percent of Hallmark America's common stock will be owned by the subsidiary's management.</p>
</text>
